{"id":"i8gnmu5p1o6cmhwjgkxsmo03j","title":"古代文献常用（今人费解）词语（154）：蜀客","originalTitle":null,"summary":"\"蜀客\"是古代文献中海棠的雅称，源于宋代姚宽《西溪丛语》中将海棠列为\"三十客\"之一。此名因海棠盛产于蜀地而得名，寓含对蜀地海棠的推崇与雅赏之意。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=1251036&do=blog&id=1560630"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T01:43:30.987Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T01:43:30.987Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":21,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}